<title>UK: Cedef names two Sydney asset management directors.</title>
<headline>Cedef names two Sydney asset management directors.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cedef SA said on Tuesday it had appointed Duncan MacPherson and David Ramsay as managing directors of the asset management arm of Cedef Group in Sydney.</p>
<p>A Cedef statement said MacPherson and Ramsey had resigned their positions as associate directors of the Sydney branch of the Intercapital Group.</p>
<p>Cedef said they will take up their appointments with Cedef once they are free of their contractual obligations to Intercapital.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6784</p>
</text>
